{"actor": "system", "cost_usd": 0.0, "event_type": "finalize", "latency_ms": 1.0, "payload": {"final_answer": "To calculate the 3-year revenue Compound Annual Growth Rate (CAGR) for Palantir Technologies from 2021 to 2024, we use the following formula:\n\n$$\\text{CAGR} = \\left( \\frac{\\text{Ending Value}}{\\text{Beginning Value}} \\right)^{\\frac{1}{n}} - 1$$\n\nWhere:\n*   **Ending Value (2024 Revenue):** $2,865.51 million (or approximately $2.87 billion)\n*   **Beginning Value (2021 Revenue):** $1,541.89 million (or approximately $1.54 billion)\n*   **n (Number of years):** 3 (from the end of 2021 to the end of 2024)\n\n**Step-by-Step Calculation:**\n1.  **Revenue 2021:** $1,541.89 million\n2.  **Revenue 2024:** $2,865.51 million\n3.  **Ratio:** $2,865.51 / 1,541.89 \\approx 1.85844$\n4.  **CAGR:** $(1.85844)^{1/3} - 1$\n5.  **Calculation:** $1.2295 - 1 = 0.2295$ or **22.95%**\n\n(Note: Revenue for 2022 was $1,905.87 million and 2023 was $2,225.01 million, confirming the growth trend.)\n\nFINAL ANSWER: 22.95%\n\n{\n    \"sources\": [\n        {\n            \"url\": \"https://www.morningstar.com/stocks/xnas/pltr/key-metrics\",\n            \"name\": \"Morningstar - Palantir Technologies Inc Key Metrics\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"url\": \"https://www.macrotrends.net/stocks/charts/PLTR/palantir-technologies/financial-statements\",\n            \"name\": \"Macrotrends - Palantir Technologies Financial Statements 2018-2026\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"url\": \"https://investors.palantir.com/news-details/2025/Palantir-Reports-Q4-2024-Revenue-Growth-of-36-YY-U.S.-Revenue-Growth-of-52-YY-Issues-FY-2025-Revenue-Guidance-of-31-YY-Growth-Eviscerating-Consensus-Estimates/\",\n            \"name\": \"Palantir Investor Relations - Q4 2024 Earnings Press Release\"\n        }\n    ]\n}", "final_reason": "single_agent", "retrieved_docids": ["2018", "2024", "2025", "2026", "31", "36", "4", "52"], "status": "completed", "success": true}, "state_id": "run_